                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S_n
                  Dijkgraaf-Witten theory, and then discuss decomposition and the branched covers interpretation. We encounter two puzzles, and to solve them, propose that the Gross-Taylor string theory has a
                  = succeed "." do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+form+symmetry"} higher-form symmetry
