                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1405.1320"} arXiv:1405.1320
              %blockquote
                %p
                  We define exotic
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+de+Rham+cohomology"} twisted
                  = succeed "-" do
