                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/AdS3%2FCFT2"} AdS3-gravity
                  observables,
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supersymmetric+indices"} supersymmetric indices
                  of
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Coulomb+branches"} Coulomb branches
                  as well as
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/AdS%2FCFT"} gauge/gravity duality
                  between all these. This suggests that
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hypothesis+H"} Hypothesis H
                  is a correct assumption about the elusive mathematical fomulation of
                  = succeed "." do
