                  reproduces the AVZ model &amp;lbrack;P.D. Alvarez, M. Valenzuela, J. Zanelli, JHEP 1204 (2012) 058,
                  = succeed "&rbrack;." do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1109.3944"} arXiv:1109.3944
                  = succeed "," do
